reconfigure_cars.description:
Add the cars you charge here. Each car has its own sensors: battery SOC, the car's own charge limit and the battery capacity. The Guest profile always exists: it has no sensors and charges in the cheapest night hours, for a visitor's car. The active car is chosen on the dashboard (or with the Active car select).

{cars}

Pick an action, or Continue (without a car only the Guest profile is created).

